<title>USA: West Deptford BOE, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</title>
<headline>West Deptford BOE, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $8.880 million of West Deptford Township Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.022 percent.</p>
